before:
Complete local C example; the app itself does not execute it:
```c
#include <stdio.h>

typedef struct Node Node;
struct Node { int value; Node *next; };
int main(void) {
 Node end = {.value = 8, .next = NULL};
 Node start = {.value = 3, .next = &end};
 printf("%d\n", start.next->value);
}
```

